# .gitignore — Human Genetics analyses
#
# Rule of thumb: anything reproducible from a script or a render does not belong
# in the repo. Without the raw_data rules below, `git add -A` here stages ~5 GB.

# ---- Downloaded data and reference panels (robust MR arm, ~4.9 GB) ------------
# All regenerable via scripts/fetch_robust_mr_data.sh.
raw_data/robust_mr/
raw_data/reference/

# ---- Render caches and intermediates -----------------------------------------
# knitr caches are large (~60 MB for prep alone) and machine-specific.
robust_mr_*_cache/
*_cache/

# Quarto project state and freeze cache.
.quarto/
_freeze/

# Quarto's per-document asset directories (bootstrap/jquery/plotly bundles).
# The robust_mr_*.qmd files set embed-resources: true, so their .html is
# self-contained and these directories are disposable. Do NOT add a blanket
# *_files/ rule — the older analyses in this repo are not self-contained and
# their .html would render unstyled without them.
robust_mr_*_files/

# ---- R session noise ---------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron

# ---- Cluster ------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
slurm-*.out
*.sbatch.log

# ---- OS ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
